1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
@WillowFishingScene{Position:Girl|x=0|y=0|z=0|face=center}{Camera:Static|position=0,0,10|lookAt=0,0,0}{SFX:Play|name=morning_birds|endTime=60|baseVolume=0.12}{SFX:Play|name=river_water|endTime=60|baseVolume=0.16}{SFX:Play|name=wind_leaves|endTime=60|baseVolume=0.12}

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,400
[Girl]{Voice:curious}小橘，今天又要去哪呀？

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,400
[Cat]{Voice:calm}去见个老朋友。

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
{SFX:Play|name=footsteps_grass_soft|baseVolume=0.24}

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,800
[Girl]{Voice:amazed}哇，这里柳树好多。

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,500
[OldMan]{Voice:calm}小橘。带朋友来了。

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,200
[Girl]{Voice:bright}爷爷好，您也认识小橘呀？

8
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:25,900
{SFX:Play|name=fishing_cast|baseVolume=0.4}

9
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:30,600
[OldMan]{Voice:calm}老相识了。这条河，它比我熟。

10
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,900
[Boy]{Voice:curious}爷爷，这鱼竿是您自己做的吗？

11
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:39,800
[OldMan]{Voice:bright}眼光不错。三十年的老伙计了。

12
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:45,000
[OldMan]{Voice:calm}最近，夜里的河面会发光。青色的。

13
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,200
[Girl]{Voice:curious}青光？

14
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:50,800
[OldMan]{Voice:calm}那光很干净。也许是我眼花了。

15
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,400
[Girl]{Voice:curious}小橘？怎么啦？

16
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,400
[Cat]{Voice:calm}没什么。

17
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,000
{Voice:calm}
